{"id":55222,"date":"2026-07-28T14:17:26","date_gmt":"2026-07-28T13:17:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=55222"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:50:54","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:50:54","slug":"baleeiros-hybrid-games","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/baleeiros-hybrid-games\/","title":{"rendered":"Baleeiros Hybrid Games 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Baleeiros Hybrid Games 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os <strong>Baleeiros Hybrid Games 2026<\/strong> realizam-se na quarta-feira, <strong>26 de Agosto de 2026<\/strong>, na hist\u00f3rica vila das <strong>Lajes do Pico<\/strong>, na <strong>Ilha do Pico, A\u00e7ores<\/strong>. Integrada na c\u00e9lebre <strong>Semana dos Baleeiros<\/strong> \u2014 a maior festividade cultural e c\u00edvica da ilha montanha \u2014, a prova presta uma vibrante homenagem \u00e0 bravura, resili\u00eancia e for\u00e7a f\u00edsica dos antigos homens do mar atrav\u00e9s de um formato moderno e eletrizante de fitness h\u00edbrido.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com centro de opera\u00e7\u00f5es no Campo de Jogos das Lajes do Pico, o in\u00edcio da competi\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 marcado para as <strong>19h00<\/strong>, disputada exclusivamente em duplas (masculinas, femininas e mistas). Os atletas enfrentam segmentos de corrida intercalados com esta\u00e7\u00f5es intensas de exerc\u00edcios funcionais (erg\u00f3metros, cargas e movimentos de for\u00e7a), premiando as equipas com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, medalha finisher exclusiva, dorsal e trof\u00e9us para o p\u00f3dio.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Agosto de 2026 \u00e0s 19:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direct